{"data":[{"type":"betaBuildLocalizations","id":"6a3772e0-d66e-4a49-b31c-a9260449ad08","attributes":{"locale":"en-US","whatsNew":"Sky Now is now a permanent second tab with a live 3D planetarium showing satellites currently above your horizon. Pan, zoom, follow your device, and select a passing satellite. Sky Now always follows the current time.\n\nFor this build, Sky Now loads at most 100 bright low-Earth-orbit satellites. Switching tabs reuses the loaded catalog, and returning to Passes reuses fresh forecasts instead of recalculating them. Leaving a tab cancels unfinished work.\n\nCatalog metadata now uses an isolated SQLite actor and an in-memory cache. Orbital timestamp parsing is faster, and satellite inclination metadata has been corrected.\n\nPlease test first load, switching tabs while loading, returning to Sky Now and Passes, location changes, background/foreground transitions, and offline use after a successful load."},"relationships":{"build":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/6a3772e0-d66e-4a49-b31c-a9260449ad08/relationships/build","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/6a3772e0-d66e-4a49-b31c-a9260449ad08/build"}}},"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/6a3772e0-d66e-4a49-b31c-a9260449ad08"}},{"type":"betaBuildLocalizations","id":"e6a48f94-06c3-446b-93ac-4785bb7ad92a","attributes":{"locale":"es-ES"},"relationships":{"build":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/e6a48f94-06c3-446b-93ac-4785bb7ad92a/relationships/build","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/e6a48f94-06c3-446b-93ac-4785bb7ad92a/build"}}},"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/betaBuildLocalizations/e6a48f94-06c3-446b-93ac-4785bb7ad92a"}},{"type":"betaBuildLocalizations","id":"8b809b87-0822-425c-b51c-ed9663846ecd","attributes":{"locale":"ko"},"relationships":{"build":{"